# This is NOT the real password file.
#
# The real file is Infra/mosquitto/passwd. It is gitignored and never committed.
# Create it with:
#
#   bash Infra/mosquitto/make-passwords.sh        (Git Bash, macOS, Linux)
#   .\Infra\mosquitto\make-passwords.ps1          (PowerShell)
#
# The script runs mosquitto_passwd inside the mosquitto container and adds:
#   - the backend user      (MQTT_USER / MQTT_PASSWORD from .env)
#   - test device bin-001   (password MQTT_TEST_DEVICE_PASSWORD from .env)
#   - test device bin-002   (password MQTT_TEST_DEVICE_PASSWORD from .env)
#
# Each line in the real file looks like:
#   username:$7$101$<salt>$<hash>
